 handling and technical competence. So we keep B.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I note the new info about D being regarded as arrogant and having weak leadership, with no specific observations on crew cooperation, communication, or adaptability. This reinforces my view that D presents higher risk in crew interaction, and given B's proven stress resilience and technical competence, I continue to recommend B.\"\n\nThen METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate B."}
